od to fulfill your destiny as a Voidborn.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve after each death with permanent abilities and weapon upgrades.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a vast and varied dark fantasy world with unlockable shortcuts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the\u00a0Trials of the Scarlet Curse, a custom difficulty system that ramps up the intensity to game-changing insanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Xekvera"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2072660/4126bf4c5bfbd5db2b6ed2245c479293761ccfda/header.jpg?t=1744034416","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2022 Xekvera. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2072660/863839/bc2323eb0995d933abd2532f3282d0f1ef9c8abf/1751071748/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744034210","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2072660/863839/bc2323eb0995d933abd2532f3282d0f1ef9c8abf/1751071748/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744034210","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2072660/863839/bc2323eb0995d933abd2532f3282d0f1ef9c8abf/1751071748/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744034210","id":257122259,"name":"Voidborn 1.0 Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122259/f8b9cb7c4b5fe0af71b4fb970952a9967386519a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744034210"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/st